  "fullDescription": "Hand-Drawn Plant & Flower Clipart Bundle (The Complete Collection!)\n\nThis is the ultimate master bundle, compiling all 28 color variations of adorable Potted Plants & Flower Clipart! This comprehensive collection features every unique illustration you’ve created, including tulips, daisies, sunflowers, leafy house plants, sprouts, and whimsical planters. Each graphic is designed in a sweet, kawaii style perfect for crafters, designers, and small businesses.\n\nThis bundle offers maximum variety for every season and project:\nFlowers: Full color-sets of Tulips, Daisies, Sunflowers, and Marigold-like blooms.\nContainers: Unique designs like the Teapot Planter, Mug Planter, Wooden Window Boxes (“Garden,” “Tulip”), and simple Terracotta Pots.\nHouseplants: Greenery for office decor, leafy sprouts, and “Organic” labeled herb pots.\nThemes: Whimsical, Spring, Gardening, Mother’s Day, and Home Decor.\n\nUse these files for sublimation on apparel and mugs, digital planning, vinyl decals, sticker sheets, and custom printables.\n\nFile Details for All 28 Designs:\nFormats: PNG, AI, EPS, and SVG (Cut Files).\nResolution: 300 DPI (Print-Ready).\nSize: 3000 x 3000 pixels.\nBackgrounds: Transparent PNGs for easy layering.\n\n✨ Your Feedback Matters!✨\nWe pour our heart into creating unique, high-quality 3D digital clipart, and your satisfaction is our top priority. If you love your new clipart and had a great experience with our shop, we would be incredibly grateful if you could leave us a review and a 5-star rating on Creative fabrica! Your feedback helps our small business grow and allows other creators to discover our unique designs. Thank you for your support!\n\n✨Eyestudiodesign✨",
